      "GroupDto": {
        "GroupName": "ORALL",
        "Description": "OR reading (inputs A and B, threshold 0.25) of the shipped \u0027Logic Gate OR-AND\u0027 gate. Role in the 4-bit zero detect: ORALL combines the two partial ORs \u2014 its output is 1 when any of A0\u2013A3 is lit. The cascade composes at the logic layer, not optically: every gate\u0027s truth table is extracted once in isolation, so each stage restores clean 0/1 levels by construction.",
